            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>updated</code> yazdırılmadan önce yapılan değişikliği takip et. Konsolda ne görüntülenir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_group = \" /><text value=\"&quot;twenty-five to thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = age_group.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty-five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"twenty-five to thirty-five\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">yirmi beş ila otuz beş</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">yirmi beş ila otuz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">yirmi beş ila otuz-otuz beş</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">yirmi beş ila otuz beş öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
