            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"The answer is Finland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Cevap Belçika'dır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Cevap Finlandiya'dır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cevap Finlandiya'dır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>replace()</code>, ilk değişkeni değiştirmeden güncellenmiş bir dize döndürür.</p><p>Değiştirme işleminden sonra <code>answer = updated</code> eklersen iki değişken hangi değerleri içerir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"The answer is Finland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hem answer hem de updated Finlandiya içerir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">answer Belçika değerini korur, updated ise Finlandiya içerir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">answer Finland içerir, updated ise Belgium değerini korur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hem answer hem de updated Finlandiya içerir.</p></body></html>",
